{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After escaping capture you discover a destroyed castle village with one desperate survivor. Help to rebuild the town for defense against known and unknown threats. Use the buildings and crafting stations to forge tools, weapons, and armor to help you in your journey to uncover the cold truth about what happens on this planet in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and collect resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft tools, weapons, armor, furniture, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build defenses, buildings, and crafting stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt and trap game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish for food and trophies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow food, materials, and medicines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress with tiered gear that follows an in depth story line deep into the moon's icy core where something cold and dark has been forgotten.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3746710?t=1761757061","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3746710?t=1761757061","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746710/07fd9be34243d866e72f56d478a6f2d50f4ca7f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761757061","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746710/07fd9be34243d866e72f56d478a6f2d50f4ca7f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761757061","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After escap